The claim endpoint uses getUserAssetsLive() which queries blockchain directly (not cached). Even 30 seconds after purchase, LIVE query should see it immediately.

Possible causes:

Frontend using cached API but backend is LIVE (most likely - just UI display lag)
Transaction hasn't been confirmed on blockchain yet (very rare, <3 seconds)
