Bug #1: db.templates.getByTemplateId is not a function
What I did wrong: Used wrong method name

// ❌ WRONG (what I wrote):
const templateConfig = db.templates.getByTemplateId(claim.template_id);

// ✅ CORRECT (what it should be):
const templateConfig = db.templates.getById(claim.template_id);

Fixed in: Lines 320 and 930

Bug #2: db.prepare is not a function
What I did wrong: Tried to use raw SQLite methods on the exports object

// ❌ WRONG (what I wrote):
const allClaims = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM claims').all();

// ✅ CORRECT (what it should be):
const allClaims = db.claims.getAll(999999);

Why: db is the module exports, not the database connection. Must use the proper claims.getAll() method.
Fixed in: Line 903

Bug #3: config is not defined
What I did wrong: Referenced config.collection_name without loading config first

// ❌ WRONG (what I wrote):
const rewardTemplate = await wax.getTemplate(config.collection_name, claim.reward_template);
// config was never defined!

// ✅ CORRECT (what it should be):
const config = db.config.get(); // Load config first!
const rewardTemplate = await wax.getTemplate(config.collection_name, claim.reward_template);

Fixed in: Lines 293 and 904

